# Normalize line endings in the repository so a Windows checkout and a
# Linux/macOS checkout agree. Without this, autocrlf converts LF to CRLF in
# the working copy only, and any tooling that hashes or diffs file bytes
# (including our own test fixtures) sees phantom changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, if any are ever added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
